      50.64,
      403.8,
      286.45,
      709.28
    ],
    "text": "My Ref No.: GAL/LAN/AQUIS/A13/35. Land Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/9/2016/WS/187. I, hereby give notice under sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as amended by the Land Acquisition (amendment Act) No. 28 of 1964 that the government intends to acquire the lands/servitude described in the Schedule given below for a public purpose Sarvitude:- Description of the lands/ servitude to be acquired : Allotment of land in extent about 0.0643 Hectare depicted in the Plan No. Ke/3643 dated 29.10.2018 prepared by Surveyor General situated in the villages of Pitagaldeniya in 67 Narangaoda Grama Niladhari Division sub division of Kandupita Pattuwa North Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Galigamuwa in the District of Kegalle in Sabaragamuva Province. 01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Kurukosgahamula Watta and Galketiye Watta; Name of the Claimant : E.M.D.R.B. Hatnagoda, Pitagaldeniya, Kegalle; Extent : 0.0378 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItal",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
