    ],
    "text": "02. Lot No. 02 Name of the Land: Kurukosgahamula Watta and Galketiye Watta; Name of the Claimant : E.M.D.R.B. Hatnagoda, Pitagaldeniya, Kegalle; Extent : 0.0265 Hectare.",
