      403.52,
      542.0,
      559.73
    ],
    "text": "Dates for Inquires: All persons interested in the aforesaid lands to be acquires are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Galigamuwa on 05.12.2018 at 10.00 a.m and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing with duplicate on or before the 28.11.2018 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
